# Completion review: ARM64 duplicate import regression

## Scope and result

Fixed only the duplicate imports reported in workflow run `40871049172`:

- `resolveAutoStrategy.ts`: removed the second identical `../autoCombo/bands`
  import; retained all four imported bindings.
- `opencodeHeaders.ts`: consolidated imports from `./opencodeCliVersion.ts`;
  retained the cached version helper, refresh helper, and v2 fallback constant.

No routing, provider, model, migration, image, workflow, or runtime behavior
changed. Added a TypeScript compiler regression test over only these two source
files. The package records the remaining normal ARM64 workflow acceptance in
root `openspec/TODO.md`.

## TDD and verification

- RED on clean base `c204f2aba69c282e582697f43ca5ca6e2cf474f2`:
